  root cause  : The ad service is not running. Its own logs end with a clean JVM-initiated gRPC server shutdown at 10:47:51 followed by total silence and no startup banner [tr_049f5c41df79], and its span-metrics series returns no samples at all — neither error nor total spans — in the incident window [tr_cf83f6da7194]. The ad change log shows seven platform-automation image-reference changes in the ~1.2 hours before onset, alternating every 11-13 minutes between an unset reference and a single hotfix tag, the last an update to that hotfix tag ~5 minutes before onset [tr_e6ff75165b3e]: the deploy loop tore the running instance down and the hotfix artifact never came back up. Frontend is the reporter, not the culprit — all its errors are gRPC status 14 UNAVAILABLE with connect EHOSTUNREACH to a single peer 172.18.0.19:9555, no connection ever established [tr_9129eb349cc8], the traces show the frontend→AdService/GetAds client span as a childless leaf with no server-side ad span while cart, product-catalog and recommendation paths complete cleanly [tr_bead95082f1d], and frontend has no change records at all [tr_73b63a0cebf6].
